# Cloudflare Web Analytics beacon token — public, embedded in the client build.
# Get it: Cloudflare dashboard -> Web Analytics -> add site installer.jarvisautomation.io -> copy token.
# Unset = analytics disabled (no-op). For the deployed site, set this as a
# GitHub repo VARIABLE named VITE_CF_BEACON_TOKEN (Settings -> Secrets and
# variables -> Actions -> Variables), NOT a secret — the deploy build reads it.
VITE_CF_BEACON_TOKEN=
